WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.600
This one has a huge reward. I'll just go in here?

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:13.123
Don't let a reward decide. First check: is this allowed where you live?

00:00:13.123 --> 00:00:16.178
Does the platform accept your real country of residence?

00:00:16.178 --> 00:00:18.087
Which company provides the service?

00:00:18.087 --> 00:00:20.760
Then look at fees, deposits and withdrawal rules.

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:34.414
Once you've confirmed the official entry,

00:00:34.414 --> 00:00:37.950
sign up with your own email or phone number, set a unique password,

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:40.167
and complete the checks the page asks for.

00:00:40.167 --> 00:00:44.020
Never buy someone else's account, and never fake your identity or region.

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:01.920
Signing up isn't the last step.

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:06.338
Turn on the security features the platform supports, check your logged-in devices,

00:01:06.338 --> 00:01:08.008
and save your recovery options.

00:01:08.008 --> 00:01:11.240
And never send a one-time code to a so-called support agent.

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:28.506
Our site can help you look things up, but a partnership is not a safety guarantee.

00:01:28.506 --> 00:01:31.360
If the facts aren't confirmed, don't start the sign-up.

00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:46.720
Stop. Confirm eligibility and the rules first.

00:01:47.020 --> 00:01:49.810
Right. Find the real door, then open the account.

00:01:56.250 --> 00:02:01.322
Want a door you can trust? NexuAlpha lists each exchange's verified official link.

00:02:01.322 --> 00:02:04.785
Our OKX partner link goes straight to the official site,

00:02:04.785 --> 00:02:06.950
and code nexu888 adds a fee rebate.

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:10.571
Do it now: turn on two-factor login. Then come back.

00:02:10.571 --> 00:02:14.040
Next, someone in a chat offers to 'do your KYC for you'.

00:02:14.450 --> 00:02:16.470
Understand first, then act.
